# Tracked in the gsd-core repo; symlinked here for convenience
.planning/UPSTREAM-GSD-ISSUES.md

# Bytecode cache from importing the Phase 30 experiment harnesses under .planning/
__pycache__/

# MemPalace capture staging. Artifacts are copied here so `mempalace mine`'s
# detect_room() can assign a room from the folder path. The directory must PERSIST
# rather than be cleaned up: mine's idempotency keys on absolute source_file + mtime,
# so deleting it makes every re-run re-file duplicate drawers. Ignored so it cannot be
# swept into an unrelated commit by a blanket `git add -A`.
.planning/.mempalace-stage/
